# BUILDFLOW – SAAS SUPER ADMIN DASHBOARD
## Complete Platform Administration, Tenant Management, Billing, Usage Analytics and Audited Support Governance

Build a complete, premium, enterprise-grade SaaS Super Admin dashboard for BuildFlow.

BuildFlow is a multi-tenant construction workforce management and site operations SaaS platform.

The SaaS Super Admin is responsible for managing the entire BuildFlow platform across all registered construction companies.

This is the highest-level platform administration role.

IMPORTANT:

This dashboard is NOT a Company Admin dashboard.

A Company Admin manages one construction company.

A SaaS Super Admin manages the entire BuildFlow SaaS ecosystem, including:

1. All registered companies (tenants).
2. Tenant subscriptions and billing.
3. Platform-wide usage analytics.
4. Subscription plans and entitlements.
5. Platform revenue and payment monitoring.
6. Platform users and account governance.
7. Customer support and audited access.
8. Platform configuration.
9. Security and audit logs.
10. System health and operational monitoring.
11. Announcements and platform notifications.
12. SaaS business intelligence.

Build the application from scratch. Do not reuse the previous Company Admin or Site Manager dashboard layout.

The result must look like a serious commercial SaaS control centre.

---

# 1. PRODUCT ARCHITECTURE AND MULTI-TENANT BUSINESS LOGIC

BuildFlow operates as a multi-tenant SaaS application.

Each registered construction company is a separate tenant.

Example:

BuildFlow Platform
|
|-- ABC Construction Pvt Ltd
|   |-- Projects
|   |-- Sites
|   |-- Employees
|   |-- HR and Payroll
|   |-- Attendance
|   |-- Procurement
|
|-- XYZ Infrastructure Ltd
|   |-- Projects
|   |-- Sites
|   |-- Employees
|
|-- GreenBuild Developers
|   |-- Projects
|   |-- Sites
|   |-- Employees

Every tenant must have isolated business records.

The SaaS Super Admin can view platform-level tenant metadata, subscription status, usage metrics and authorized support information.

Never create a global database query that exposes all customer payroll, bank information, identity documents or private employee records.

Customer support access must use a separate audited and time-limited authorization workflow.

### Core distinction

The Super Admin can manage:
- Tenant account status.
- Tenant subscription.
- Plan configuration.
- Billing configuration.
- Platform-level usage limits.
- Platform-level security policies.
- Support requests.
- Platform service health.

The Super Admin must not silently modify:
- Customer payroll.
- Employee attendance.
- Employee salaries.
- Company purchase records.
- Project financial records.
- Customer documents.

Any exceptional support access must require explicit authorization, a business reason, limited scope, expiry and audit logging.

