# 26. IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULES

1. The SaaS Super Admin is separate from all customer company administrators.
2. A tenant suspension must not delete customer records.
3. Subscription plan changes must preserve billing history.
4. Existing customer entitlements must be versioned.
5. Revenue analytics must distinguish MRR, ARR and collected revenue.
6. Failed payments must not automatically be marked as successful.
7. Refunds must be confirmed by the payment gateway.
8. Support access must be limited, approved, time-bound and audited.
9. Customer payroll and private employee records must not appear in general platform analytics.
10. Tenant isolation must be enforced by backend policies.
11. Platform administrators must follow least-privilege access.
12. Audit logs must be append-only.
13. Critical actions must require confirmation and a reason.
14. Sensitive operations should support maker-checker approval.
15. Demo system-health metrics must never be represented as actual uptime.

